1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Fortieth Episode
The Hunt

15
00:02:15,621 --> 00:02:18,613
His Most Excellent Majesty,
the King of Terra Verde!

16
00:02:21,901 --> 00:02:25,018
That King is the most majestic
of those who have arrived!

17
00:02:25,061 --> 00:02:27,655
He might even manage to win
the hunting tournament!

18
00:02:27,741 --> 00:02:29,777
Look what a beautiful prize!
And how it shines!

19
00:02:29,821 --> 00:02:31,732
I heard it's made of gold!

20
00:02:31,821 --> 00:02:34,335
How wonderful, a suit of golden armor!

21
00:02:34,381 --> 00:02:37,578
Whoever proves to be
the best of the tournament will win it

22
00:02:38,301 --> 00:02:40,451
His Majesty, the King of Forgland!

23
00:02:42,341 --> 00:02:44,730
His Lordship, Lord Lampski!

24
00:02:46,141 --> 00:02:50,134
Their Royal Highnesses, the Bokeron
brothers of the Kingdom of Bokeron!

25
00:02:51,901 --> 00:02:54,335
His Grace, Duke Dolcon!

26
00:02:55,101 --> 00:02:57,012
Hello, everyone!

27
00:02:57,061 --> 00:02:59,814
His Highness, Prince
Franco of Goldland!

28
00:03:01,781 --> 00:03:04,932
- Oh, how wonderful!
- How kind and strong he is!

29
00:03:04,981 --> 00:03:06,972
I wish he would win!

30
00:03:09,741 --> 00:03:13,780
His Most Excellent Grace,
the Grand Duke of Vosgaria!

31
00:03:19,781 --> 00:03:21,772
Should I wear this dress?

32
00:03:22,821 --> 00:03:26,416
... maybe this other one is better?
And what do you think of this one?

33
00:03:26,461 --> 00:03:29,533
How can anyone spend
hours trying on clothes?

34
00:03:42,461 --> 00:03:45,771
It will be an extremely interesting
competition, Grand Duke.

35
00:03:49,221 --> 00:03:52,213
- Are you Duke Geralamon?
- Yes, why?

36
00:03:54,901 --> 00:03:57,415
I belong to Union X.

37
00:03:57,501 --> 00:04:00,095
I have come to ask you
a big favor.

38
00:04:00,821 --> 00:04:04,894
This is our gift for you.
I earnestly ask you to accept it.

39
00:04:05,781 --> 00:04:08,215
What do you want me to do?

40
00:04:08,261 --> 00:04:10,570
Have you seen Prince Franco?

41
00:04:17,421 --> 00:04:20,094
But really, will you tell me
why Sapphire is taking so long?

42
00:04:20,141 --> 00:04:22,780
The Princess
is choosing her dress!

43
00:04:24,381 --> 00:04:27,214
I have a feeling I'm going to wear
this very dress!

44
00:04:27,301 --> 00:04:29,815
Hi, Franco!
Welcome!

45
00:04:30,101 --> 00:04:32,092
Oh, hi, Franco! How are you?

46
00:04:32,661 --> 00:04:35,971
It's a joke!
Prince Franco isn't here!

47
00:04:36,021 --> 00:04:39,980
What?!
Stop making fun of me!

48
00:04:40,381 --> 00:04:44,977
I'm sorry!
I just wanted to play a joke on you!

49
00:04:45,421 --> 00:04:47,412
Wait, Choppy!

50
00:04:50,021 --> 00:04:51,932
Sapphire!

51
00:04:52,301 --> 00:04:55,771
Oh, Franco...!
How are you now? Are you okay?

52
00:04:55,821 --> 00:04:57,891
- Yes!
- Thank you for inviting me

53
00:04:58,621 --> 00:05:00,612
Well, you see...

54
00:05:14,941 --> 00:05:18,331
- The signal!
- Platoon, roll the drums!

55
00:05:52,341 --> 00:05:54,855
Prince Franco,
what a pleasure to see you!

56
00:05:55,261 --> 00:05:57,934
Your horse is magnificent,
however word is going around...

57
00:05:57,981 --> 00:06:00,449
...that the horses of Goldland
are not well-trained...

58
00:06:00,501 --> 00:06:03,538
...and don't know how to gallop, even
if they look magnificent!

59
00:06:05,461 --> 00:06:07,816
That’s not true!
That is just a lie!

60
00:06:08,101 --> 00:06:11,173
Then let’s try to have a
little race to the swamp!

61
00:06:12,261 --> 00:06:15,333
- All right, I accept!
- Franco!

62
00:06:15,860 --> 00:06:18,614
Don’t worry, I won’t
lose! I’m ready, Baron!

63
00:06:27,420 --> 00:06:30,492
Very well!
The trick worked!

64
00:06:30,540 --> 00:06:34,090
Now it’s your turn, my falcon.
Go!

65
00:06:50,820 --> 00:06:53,494
Oh... Look, a falcon!

66
00:06:58,500 --> 00:07:01,060
But those are Franco
and Lord Neelon.

67
00:07:01,780 --> 00:07:05,171
I’m afraid the Baron is
up to one of his tricks!

68
00:07:05,700 --> 00:07:08,135
Run, deer friend,
I want to follow them!

69
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:15,412
The swamp is to the right!

70
00:07:19,740 --> 00:07:23,370
This road leads to the
cemetery! Now it's in my hands!

71
00:07:38,260 --> 00:07:40,172
Alarm! Warn Gagoal!

72
00:07:40,220 --> 00:07:42,530
- The black falcon is coming!
- Right away!

73
00:07:48,100 --> 00:07:50,012
Forward!

74
00:07:50,980 --> 00:07:53,973
- What's happening?
- The black falcon has arrived!

75
00:07:58,100 --> 00:08:01,218
Really? Let's see...

76
00:08:04,420 --> 00:08:07,333
You stupid Prince!

77
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:10,419
It's over for you!

78
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:18,335
The signal! There's the signal!

79
00:08:18,940 --> 00:08:21,899
Slaves!
To work!

80
00:08:44,661 --> 00:08:48,893
Strange! There is no swamp
here! This is a cemetery!

81
00:09:46,021 --> 00:09:49,491
Did you see?
I am the most skilled hunter!

82
00:09:49,581 --> 00:09:52,937
No, sir!
I am the most skilled hunter!

83
00:09:55,501 --> 00:09:59,414
No! I am the most skilled! Look
at how much game I caught!

84
00:10:00,181 --> 00:10:03,491
Oh, really?! Then look at
what a huge beast I captured!

85
00:10:04,581 --> 00:10:07,334
- I won!
- No, I did!

86
00:10:08,981 --> 00:10:12,098
- How come Franco isn't coming back?
- Princess Sapphire!

87
00:10:12,741 --> 00:10:15,130
Prince Franco has lost the challenge!

88
00:10:15,181 --> 00:10:17,331
- And where is he?
- Can you imagine it?

89
00:10:17,381 --> 00:10:21,818
After losing, he cowardly
ran away to Goldland in tears!

90
00:10:21,861 --> 00:10:23,852
He's truly a spineless weakling!

91
00:10:23,901 --> 00:10:25,892
Think of the fool he made
of himself in front of you!

92
00:10:29,541 --> 00:10:31,532
It's not possible.

93
00:10:40,221 --> 00:10:42,781
Today I really enjoyed myself!

94
00:10:42,821 --> 00:10:45,733
Me too! It's been a long time since we've had a hunt like this!

95
00:10:45,821 --> 00:10:48,654
You're a truly fine hunter, you know?

96
00:10:48,701 --> 00:10:50,692
You too! You too!

97
00:10:51,141 --> 00:10:53,052
It was truly exciting!

98
00:10:53,101 --> 00:10:55,934
- But there is one thing that worries me!
- What?!

99
00:10:55,981 --> 00:10:58,290
You don't know the Union, but I do!

100
00:10:58,661 --> 00:11:00,538
Eh?! The Union?!

101
00:11:00,661 --> 00:11:04,449
It's terrible! Sooner or later they will arrive in our country too!

102
00:11:04,501 --> 00:11:07,493
Every tree, every blade of grass, will be hexed!

103
00:11:08,141 --> 00:11:12,134
And people will go around desperately looking for food!

104
00:11:12,421 --> 00:11:14,571
Then Union X will arrive!

105
00:11:14,701 --> 00:11:17,295
Its members will burn our houses...

106
00:11:17,341 --> 00:11:19,491
...and kill the people without mercy!

107
00:11:19,781 --> 00:11:22,295
All this will happen in a very short time!

108
00:11:22,541 --> 00:11:26,250
It seems they are in possession of many weapons so lethal...

109
00:11:26,301 --> 00:11:29,338
...that our imagination cannot conceive of them!

110
00:11:29,501 --> 00:11:32,334
Thus they will make a desert around us!

111
00:11:35,621 --> 00:11:38,897
And after the destruction they will provide food to the people,

112
00:11:38,941 --> 00:11:41,091
but this food will contain a drug...

113
00:11:41,141 --> 00:11:44,178
...that will take away from man every power of thought and struggle!

114
00:11:44,301 --> 00:11:47,896
That way we will all end up
working in the service of Union X!

115
00:11:48,021 --> 00:11:50,489
Union X is a horrible clique!

116
00:11:50,581 --> 00:11:56,133
- It's terrible!
- It's truly incredible!

117
00:11:56,221 --> 00:11:58,940
What he says is true! I've
already heard about it...

118
00:11:58,981 --> 00:12:01,097
...from a neighbor of mine
before he disappeared!

119
00:12:01,141 --> 00:12:03,097
But then we are in danger!

120
00:12:03,341 --> 00:12:06,731
Of course, if he were right,
it would be truly serious!

121
00:12:06,781 --> 00:12:08,772
- What do you think?
- It's worrying!

122
00:12:25,941 --> 00:12:29,172
Franco, I don't believe
what Baron Neelon said!

123
00:12:29,621 --> 00:12:32,897
But where could you
be now? If only I knew..!

124
00:12:36,781 --> 00:12:38,772
Sapphire!

125
00:12:39,381 --> 00:12:42,339
Sapphire, Prince Frank
is in danger!

126
00:12:42,381 --> 00:12:44,611
He has been kidnapped
by a mysterious old woman..

127
00:12:44,661 --> 00:12:47,016
...in a cemetery,
beyond the forest!

128
00:12:47,061 --> 00:12:49,256
What?! Show me the way!

129
00:13:20,301 --> 00:13:22,417
When this boy dies

130
00:13:22,461 --> 00:13:26,420
we will have no trouble
seizing Goldland!

131
00:13:26,461 --> 00:13:29,453
When the underground empire
is completed...

132
00:13:29,501 --> 00:13:32,937
...we will easily crush
Silverland too!

133
00:13:34,821 --> 00:13:38,052
You are awake,
but you will be for only a short while,

134
00:13:38,101 --> 00:13:41,855
because this time
you will fall asleep forever!

135
00:13:45,141 --> 00:13:47,974
- What are you doing?
- Look up! Do you see?

136
00:13:48,021 --> 00:13:51,934
There are fifty tons
of iron hanging from a rope!

137
00:13:52,021 --> 00:13:56,537
And that rope will break
in about half an hour!

138
00:13:56,581 --> 00:14:00,335
That way you'll have time to enjoy yourself!

139
00:14:42,661 --> 00:14:44,731
- Did it happen here, Choppy?
- Yes!

140
00:14:45,101 --> 00:14:47,012
Let's look for a clue!

141
00:14:49,341 --> 00:14:51,218
Sapphire...

142
00:14:52,221 --> 00:14:54,894
This place looks
very sinister!

143
00:14:56,501 --> 00:14:58,571
Someone is coming!
Away!

144
00:15:03,181 --> 00:15:06,332
- I think I heard a voice.
- Maybe you imagined it.

145
00:15:11,421 --> 00:15:13,696
Who knows where
this opening leads...!

146
00:15:19,741 --> 00:15:22,653
They have built a fortress
underground!

147
00:15:25,141 --> 00:15:27,132
Choppy! Choppy!

148
00:15:30,941 --> 00:15:32,932
Help!

149
00:15:35,101 --> 00:15:39,174
- Sapphire!
- Don't be afraid, Choppy. I will help you!

150
00:15:40,741 --> 00:15:43,209
Someone is coming, hide!

151
00:15:44,021 --> 00:15:47,411
I'm sorry, Choppy, but if
they catch me now, it's over!

152
00:15:49,821 --> 00:15:51,812
A human!

153
00:16:54,821 --> 00:16:57,335
Move! Work or it
will be worse for you!

154
00:16:57,461 --> 00:17:00,214
Get up! Did you hear
me? Get up, I said!

155
00:17:01,021 --> 00:17:03,012
It's terrible!

156
00:17:03,061 --> 00:17:05,370
Just as I suspected!
This is the X Union...

157
00:17:05,421 --> 00:17:07,571
...that Lord Fougwarf
told us about!

158
00:17:08,021 --> 00:17:10,171
They have captured people
from other countries...

159
00:17:10,221 --> 00:17:12,212
...and they make
them work as slaves.

160
00:17:12,941 --> 00:17:14,852
Mercy...

161
00:17:20,621 --> 00:17:24,057
Take this! For you!

162
00:17:24,821 --> 00:17:27,540
They must have taken Franco too,
but where are they keeping him?

163
00:17:28,581 --> 00:17:30,492
Franco, where are you...?

164
00:17:42,381 --> 00:17:44,941
So, what were you doing here?

165
00:17:45,061 --> 00:17:48,258
You must speak! Confess!
Confess, you shrimp!

166
00:17:48,301 --> 00:17:50,292
I am not a shrimp,
I am Choppy!

167
00:17:50,341 --> 00:17:53,014
It doesn't matter!
Tell me who you came with!

168
00:17:53,061 --> 00:17:55,416
You certainly couldn't
have come alone!

169
00:17:55,541 --> 00:18:00,899
Choppy?! Boy, aren't you the one
who is always following Sapphire?

170
00:18:01,021 --> 00:18:03,979
I don't follow Sapphire,
I am his assistant!

171
00:18:05,981 --> 00:18:11,374
Prince Sapphire! We can
kill two birds with one stone!

172
00:18:11,421 --> 00:18:13,889
Watch Franco closely!

173
00:18:13,941 --> 00:18:17,217
Kill every suspicious person
you encounter!

174
00:18:19,341 --> 00:18:21,855
Yes! As for you, shrimp,

175
00:18:21,901 --> 00:18:25,814
I will stop you from being
impertinent with me ever again!

176
00:18:34,541 --> 00:18:37,214
If that child wanted to choose
a suitable place to die,

177
00:18:37,261 --> 00:18:39,331
he couldn't have found
a better place!

178
00:18:40,021 --> 00:18:43,696
- The captain wants to speak with you!
- Yes, let's go right away!

179
00:18:46,021 --> 00:18:48,376
- Franco, it's me!
- Sapphire, run!

180
00:18:48,421 --> 00:18:51,219
Go away, please!
This is the Union X Fortress!

181
00:18:51,261 --> 00:18:53,491
No, Franco!
I came to save you!

182
00:18:53,541 --> 00:18:55,452
Don't show yourself
or they will kill you too!

183
00:18:55,501 --> 00:18:57,696
I am not an ordinary girl,
you know it!

184
00:18:58,221 --> 00:19:00,337
- Get away!
- But...

185
00:19:01,221 --> 00:19:03,212
Go home!

186
00:19:07,461 --> 00:19:09,691
What?! I didn't call you at all!

187
00:19:09,741 --> 00:19:12,096
Damn it, the one who
told you that is Sapphire!

188
00:19:12,141 --> 00:19:15,816
He entered the base with
the crumb! Let's look for him!

189
00:19:24,621 --> 00:19:26,691
Run! Save yourself, Sapphire!

190
00:19:39,021 --> 00:19:41,615
Thank goodness!
He's still tied up tight!

191
00:19:43,661 --> 00:19:47,813
But where is that damn spy
disguised as a member of Union X?

192
00:19:47,861 --> 00:19:49,977
- Here I am!
- Where is he? Where is he?

193
00:19:58,221 --> 00:20:00,371
Here I am!

194
00:20:03,101 --> 00:20:06,889
- A masked knight!
- I've come to save you, Prince!

195
00:20:06,941 --> 00:20:10,934
- Masked or not, let's kill him!
- Watch out!

196
00:20:18,181 --> 00:20:20,172
There's not much time!

197
00:20:39,261 --> 00:20:41,331
What?! The alarm!

198
00:20:43,181 --> 00:20:46,412
There's a spy in the Fortress!
Kill her!

199
00:20:46,541 --> 00:20:52,013
- Quick, let's catch her!
- Yes, let's go! Kill her!

200
00:21:04,461 --> 00:21:07,100
Thank you, you saved
my life, masked knight!

201
00:21:07,141 --> 00:21:09,939
- Choppy is in their hands!
- I'm following you! Let's go!

202
00:21:14,781 --> 00:21:18,376
- Who is that masked knight?
- Whoever he is, he doesn't scare me!

203
00:21:18,421 --> 00:21:20,776
Don't worry,
he'll come to a bad end!

204
00:21:20,821 --> 00:21:23,289
- But that...
- So you are with them too!

205
00:21:26,101 --> 00:21:29,980
Yes, exactly! The King
of Blackland is in Union X!

206
00:21:31,821 --> 00:21:36,372
Let's lure them into the central cave!
It will be easier to fight them there!

207
00:21:41,021 --> 00:21:44,377
- Don't let them escape!
- Forward! Let's get them!

208
00:21:51,381 --> 00:21:54,737
- We have come to free you!
- What?! A masked knight?

209
00:21:54,781 --> 00:21:57,170
The time has come
to destroy Union X!

210
00:21:58,021 --> 00:22:00,171
The masked knight is right!

211
00:22:00,221 --> 00:22:03,338
It's the moment we've been
waiting for! Let's destroy Union X!

212
00:22:08,221 --> 00:22:11,179
Damn it, the slaves
are rebelling!

213
00:22:11,221 --> 00:22:13,576
- Where are you going?
- Handle it yourselves!

214
00:22:13,621 --> 00:22:16,215
I must return to my kingdom,
I have too much to do there!

215
00:22:16,261 --> 00:22:18,331
Damn it!

216
00:22:47,021 --> 00:22:49,012
Wait!

217
00:22:50,381 --> 00:22:53,418
You will all die like rats!
Too bad for you!

218
00:22:53,461 --> 00:22:56,419
The underground empire will collapse!

219
00:23:30,741 --> 00:23:33,050
Masked knight!
Prince Franco!

220
00:23:33,101 --> 00:23:35,456
- This way!
- It's Choppy!

221
00:23:35,501 --> 00:23:38,140
- Quickly! Or we will be crushed!
- Come!

222
00:23:41,621 --> 00:23:44,419
- Quick, let's escape!
- Come!

223
00:24:06,221 --> 00:24:09,611
That masked knight
has spoiled our plans!

224
00:24:09,661 --> 00:24:12,095
He has thwarted
the plans of Union X!

225
00:24:12,901 --> 00:24:15,335
No, Union X
does not give up yet!

226
00:24:15,381 --> 00:24:19,374
Soon we will conquer Silverland
and we will rule over that land too!

227
00:24:29,621 --> 00:24:32,693
So Union X
was not an imaginary danger!

228
00:24:32,741 --> 00:24:36,097
Don't worry, whatever
should happen to Silverland,

229
00:24:36,141 --> 00:24:39,895
- I will always run to your aid!
- I thank you with all my heart, Franco!

230
00:24:40,341 --> 00:24:44,698
We are all truly very grateful to you
for helping us! Thank you, friends!

231
00:24:44,901 --> 00:24:47,540
Thank you! May God bless you!

232
00:24:47,581 --> 00:24:49,970
You know, I am really confused!

233
00:25:24,420 --> 00:25:28,040
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

234
00:25:28,041 --> 00:25:31,401
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

235
00:25:31,402 --> 00:25:35,172
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

236
00:25:35,173 --> 00:25:38,334
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

237
00:25:38,335 --> 00:25:42,148
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
